@ITAM.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5151
@token =

### Status
GET {{ITAM.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Status
Accept: application/json

###

### Login
POST {{ITAM.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@itam.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###

### Me
GET {{ITAM.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Assets paged + facets
GET {{ITAM.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Assets?search=DELL&status=Disponible&category=Laptop&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Assets multi location / kind
GET {{ITAM.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Assets?locationIds=1&locationIds=2&kinds=1&kinds=2&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Movements history
GET {{ITAM.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Assignments/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
